      "raw": "<p>Playing in the Bloodsworn Colosseum the game started with &quot;Stonejaw&quot; as the first title in an (H)=3 game.</p><p>By the end of the second round Stealth Bot entered play, taking Stoneskin (did some work to set that one up).</p><p>Then things got interesting.</p><p>Taking the first hit from target Kaargra, one from Dymkharn and a hit from the Kraken gave Stealth Bot &quot;The Mindbreaker&quot;.</p><p>Mind Breaker quickly earned Stealth Bot &quot;The Indiscriminate&quot;, which at 2 damage earned her &quot;Champion&quot;.</p><p>A tie for Fickle Fans (2+2=4) earned Stealth Bot &quot;Reckless&quot;, and some timely healing form that, and other things would earn it &quot;The Unbreakable&quot;.</p><p>This was all aided by [Redacted] (a not released hero that can do some healing) focusing on keeping our Golem friend alive.</p><p>So we ended up with Stealth Bot earning 6 titles, leading the team in damage and nearly taking out Unity on more than one occasion. &nbsp;Fortunately we were able to keep &quot;The Seeker&quot; off of Stealth Bot or we would have lost horribly to our berserk little friend.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
